        '[[{"type":"text","value":"William was one of the King’s Men who were keeping an eye on Robin Hood but he also took part in the bow and arrow competition."}],[{"type":"text","value":"William did not appear in the competition despite giving his name for that since he knew that he would lose to Robin Hood."}],[{"type":"text","value":"William was a very good archer but he was not in the same class as Robin Hood."}],[{"type":"text","value":"William was a part of the Army of Robin Hood though he could not make it to the competition along with other members of the army."}]]',
