        '2026-04-11 13:35:05.900897'
    ),
    (
        678,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Which among the following is a lesson that should be learnt from the diplomacy surrounding the acceptance of membership of India into the Wassenaar Agreement?"}]',
        '[[{"type":"text","value":"It is easier to sneak into any group where other Asian countries are not there and common interests are not taken into account."}],[{"type":"text","value":"The government should understand the way in which partnership can be forged rather than shouting too much on the public forum."}],[{"type":"text","value":"India should have good spokespersons so that the stand taken by the country can be explained at any international summits without any confusion."}],[{"type":"text","value":"The government should start any negotiation process well in advance in order to avoid any kind of rush during the actual summit."}]]',
