        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: “Podcast” literally means ‘a digital audio file made available on the Internet for downloading to a computer or mobile device, typically available as a series, new installments of which can be received by subscribers automatically’. “Podcast” is a portmanteau word (a word blending the sounds and combining the meanings of two others), a made-up word coined from a combination of the words iPod and broadcast. Obviously, Option C is the correct answer."}]',
