        '[{"type":"text","value":"1418"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: In this type of problem we find the difference of divisors and their remainders. Here difference, 32 - 10 = 22 40 - 18 = 22 72 - 50 = 22 Here, in each case difference is same i.e. 22 Then required number of pebbles is given by [(LCM of 32, 40, 72) -22] 32 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 40 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 5 72 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 3 × 3 Hence, LCM = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 3 × 3 × 5 = 1440 Thus, Required number of pebbles, = 1440 - 22 = 1418"}]',
