        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: Using options, We find that four consecutive odd numbers are 37, 39, 41 and 43 The sum of these 4 numbers is 160, when divided by 10 we get 16 which is a perfect square. Thus, 41 is one of the odd numbers"}]',
