        '[{"type":"text","value":"None of these"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option D Solution: They will ring together after, LCM of 48 and 50 secs. 48 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 3; 50 = 2 × 5 × 5 LCM = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 3 × 5 × 5 = 1200 secs = 20 min. They will beep together at 12:20"}]',
