        '[{"type":"text","value":"9:08:24"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option B Solution: LCM of 36, 42 and 72, 36 = 2 × 2 × 3 × 3 42 = 2 × 3 × 7 72 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 3 × 3 LCM = 2 ×2 × 2 × 3 × 3 × 7 = 504 seconds. LCM of 36, 42 and 72 is 504 Hence, the lights will change simultaneously after 8 minutes and 24 seconds."}]',
