        '[{"type":"text","value":"97"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option D Solution: The total wages earned during the 15 days that the worker worked , = 15 × 90 = Rs. 1350 The total wages earned during the first 7 days = 7 × 87 = Rs. 609 The total wages earned during the last 7 days = 7 × 92 = Rs. 644 Total wages earned during the 15 days, = wages during first 7 days + wage on 8 th day + wages during the last 7 days. 1350 = 609 + wage on 8 th day + 644 wage on 8 th day = 1350 - 609 - 644 = Rs. 97"}]',
