        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option A Solution: Let Ashish weight X kg. According to Ashish , 55 < X < 62 According to Ashish''s father, 50 < X < 60 According to Ashish''s sister, X < 58 The values satisfying all the above conditions are 56 & 57. Therefore, Required average = So, the Ashish''s weight is 56.5 kg."}]',
