    (
        1214,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"The average of the three numbers x, y and z is 45. x is greater than the average of y and z by 9. The average of y and z is greater than y by 2. Then the difference of x and z is"}]',
        '[[{"type":"text","value":"3"}],[{"type":"text","value":"5"}],[{"type":"text","value":"7"}],[{"type":"text","value":"11"}]]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"7"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: Average of x, y and z = 45 ∴ x + y + z = 45 × 3 = 135 ...(i) According to the question, x = ⇒ 2x – y – z = 18 ...(ii) Again, according to the question, = y + 2 ⇒ z – y = 4 ...(iii) By equations (i) and (ii), 3x = 153 ⇒ x = 51 By equation (i) and (iii), x + 2z = 139 ⇒ 51 + 2z = 139 ⇒ 2z = 139 – 51 = 88 ⇒ z = 44 Now, difference of x and z = x – z = 51 – 44 = 7"}]',
