        '[{"type":"text","value":"The data given below shows the average monthly expenditure of Mr. Gyanenda Modi. I. During the first 3 months he spends Rs. 1800. II. He spends Rs. 1850 during the next 4 months. III. And Rs. 2720 during the last 5 months of a year. If the total savings during the year were Rs. 912, then the average monthly income was:"}]',
        '[[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 2605"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 2276"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 2286"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 2905"}]]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 2276"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option B Solution: Total expenditure for the year = [1800 × 3 + 1850 × 4 + 2720 × 5] = 5400 + 7400 + 13600 = Rs. 26400 Total saving = Rs. 912 Total income = expenses + savings = 26400 + 912 = Rs. 27312 Average income = = Rs. 2276"}]',
