        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option A Solution: Let Ashu''s salary = 100; Ashu''s salary after rise = 125 Then Vicky''s salary = 175 Vicky''s salary after rise of 40% = 245 [As 10% of Vicky''s salary is 17.5 then 40% = 17.5 × 4 = 70] Difference between Vicky''s salary and Ashu''s salary = 245 - 125 = 120 % more Vicky''s salary than Ashu''s = =96%"}]',
