        '[{"type":"text","value":"66"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: Let the percentage marks in QA =(10a + b)% Let the percentage marks in DI = (10b + a)% Let the percentage marks in VA = x% Now, according to the question, we have, = x 11a+11b+x=3x or, x = Clearly, we can see that the percentage of the VA section will be a multiple of 11 So, required answer will be 66"}]',
