        1258,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"A part of Anil''s salary is constant and a part of it is variable. His variable salary increased by 50% and 33.33% at the end of two consecutive years as a result of which his total salary now is 30% more than his total salary 2 years back. What percent of his total salary was his fixed salary 2 years ago?"}]',
