        '[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 265.80"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: Let A''s capital = Rs. x Then, B''s capital = Rs. (x - 600) C''s capital = Rs. (x - 600) - 300 = Rs. (x - 900) ∴ x + (x - 600) + (x - 900) = 3000 ⇒ 3x = 4500 ⇒ x = 1500 So, A:B:C=1500:900:600 =5:3:2 Hence, B''s share=Rs.(886× )=Rs. 265.80"}]',
