    (
        1329,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"P, Q and R hire a meadow for ₹ 2920. P puts 10 cows for 20 days, Q puts 30 cows for 8 days and R puts 16 cows for 9 days. Find the rent paid by R."}]',
        '[[{"type":"text","value":"₹ 735"}],[{"type":"text","value":"₹ 820"}],[{"type":"text","value":"₹ 575"}],[{"type":"text","value":"₹ 720"}]]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"₹ 575"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: Ratio of rents to be paid by P, Q and R Ratio of monthly equivalent = (10 x 20) : (30 x 8) : (16 x 9) = 200 : 240 : 144 = 25 : 30 : 18 Hence R''s share = [18/(25 + 30 + 18)] x 2920 = (18/73) x 2920 = 18 x 40 = ₹ 720"}]',
