    (
        1335,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"A is a working and B is a sleeping partner in a business. A puts in Rs. 12,000 and B Rs. 20,000. A receives 10% of the profit for managing, the rest being divided in proportion to their capitals. Out of a total profit of Rs. 9600 the money received by A is ?"}]',
