        '[{"type":"text","value":"A child has three different kinds of chocolates costing Rs.2, Rs.5, Rs.10. He spends total Rs. 120 on the chocolates. what is the minimum possible number of chocolates he can buy, if there must be atleast one chocolate of each kind?"}]',
