        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option A Solution: According to the question, 33.33% of the number of male= 1/2 of the number of female Male = Male : Female = 3 : 2 Let Male = 3x and Female = 2x Then sum = 5x = 250, x = 50 Required difference = 3x – 2x = x = 50"}]',
