        1388,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"The average age of four friends Reena, Sandhya, Yamini and Sujata is 21 years. The sum of the age of Reena and Sandhya is 14 years more than the age of Sujata. The difference between the age of Sujata and Sandhya is 4 years the difference between the age of Sujata and Reena is 6 years. Find the average age of Reena, Sandhya and Yamini after 3 years."}]',
        '[[{"type":"text","value":"22 years"}],[{"type":"text","value":"25 years"}],[{"type":"text","value":"21 years"}],[{"type":"text","value":"23 years"}]]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"23 years"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option D Solution: Let the present age of Reena, Sandhya, Yamini and Sujata be R, Sa, Y and Su respectively. R + Sa + Y + Su = 21 × 4 = 84 years ...(i) R + Sa = Su + 14 ...(ii) Su – Sa = 4 Sa = Su – 4 Su – R = 6 R = Su – 6 Put the value of R and Sa in (ii) Su – 6 + Su – 4 = Su +14 Su = 24 years R = 18 years Sa = 20 years From (i), Y = 22 years Average age after 3 years, = = 23 years"}]',
