        '[{"type":"text","value":"11 days"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option A Solution: One day''s work of A, B and C = = . C leaves 4 days before completion of the work, which means only A and B work during the last 4 days. Work done by A and B together in the last 4 days = = . Remaining Work = 7/10, which was done by A,B and C in the initial number of days. Number of days required for this initial work = 7 days. Thus, the total numbers of days required = 4 + 7 = 11 days."}]',
