        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option B Solution: Ratio of times taken by P & Q = 100 : 130 = 10:13 Let Q takes x days to do the work Then, 10:13 :: 23:x => x = 23x13/10 => x = 299/10 P''s 1 day''s work = 1/23 Q''s 1 day''s work = 10/299 (P+Q)''s 1 day''s work = (1/23 + 10/299) = 23/299 = 1/13 Hence, P & Q together can complete the work in 13 days."}]',
