        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: Let 1 man''s 1 day work = x and 1 woman''s 1 day work = y. Then, 4x + 6y = 1/8 and 3x + 7y = 1/10 Solving these two equations, we get: x = 11/400 and y = 1/400 10 woman''s 1 day work = (1/400 x 10) = 1/40. Hence, 10 women will complete the work in 40 days."}]',
