        '[{"type":"text","value":"4 days"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option C Solution: From the given data, => (2 M + 3W) 8 = (3M + 2W)7 => 16M + 24W = 21M + 14 W => 10W = 5M => 2W = M => 14W × ? = 7W × 8 ? = 4 days"}]',
