    ),
    (
        1417,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Ankit alone can do a piece of work in 6 days and Bishal alone in 8 days. Ankit and Bishal undertook to do it for Rs. 4800. With the help of Dinesh, they completed the work in 3 days. How much is to be paid to Dinesh?"}]',
        '[[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 1375"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 1400"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 1600"}],[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 1800"}]]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Rs. 1400"}]',
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Answer: Option B Solution: Ankit’s 1day work = 1/6 Bishal’s 1 day work = 1/8 (Ankit + Bishal + Dinesh)’s 1 day work =1/3 Dinesh’s 1 day work = 1/3 – (1/6+1/8) = 1/24 Ankit’s wages : Bishal’s wages : Dinesh’s wages =1/6 : 1/8 : 1/24. Here the (LCM of 6,8 and 24) is 24. Now, taking LCM we get ratio = 4 : 3 : 1 Dinesh’s share (for 3 days) = 3 × 1/8 × 4800 = 1800"}]',
        4,
