        1437,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"Three masons were tasked to build a wall together, each of them alone could build a wall in 15 days. There was another person, Manish who didn''t want the wall to be built, so he used to destroy a part of the wall every day. He alone can destroy a completely built wall in 7 days. If the wall is being built by 3 masons simultaneously and simultaneously being destroyed by Manish, then in how many days will the wall be completed once?"}]',
