        1438,
        '[{"type":"text","value":"A can do a piece of work in 40 days, B can do the same piece of work in 30 days whereas C can finish it in 20 days. They worked together for 3 days. After 3 days B left and A and C together finished the remaining task. If they are paid Rs 2000 for the complete work then find the share of B."}]',
